    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mad machinations are underfoot on the Dirt Path. Take up arms and defend the Dirt Path with divine arms.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broaden your horizons and dynamically\u00a0<strong>scale up</strong> the battle after each wave!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the the <strong>yapping wizards</strong> aiding in your Tower Defence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the overwhelming hordes and be granted\u00a0<strong>epic</strong>\u00a0<strong>ranks</strong> from the Grand Tutorial Wizard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upend the corruption of the system and enact social change, one Gnoblin at a time... Or ruin the fields by enacting zoning for the Ballistas. Again.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mad machinations are underfoot on the Dirt Path. Take up arms and defend the Dirt Path with divine arms.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broaden your horizons and dynamically\u00a0<strong>scale up</strong> the battle after each wave!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the the <strong>yapping wizards</strong> aiding in your Tower Defence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the overwhelming hordes and be granted\u00a0<strong>epic</strong>\u00a0<strong>ranks</strong> from the Grand Tutorial Wizard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upend the corruption of the system and enact social change, one Gnoblin at a time... Or ruin the fields by enacting zoning for the Ballistas. Again.</p></li></ul>",
